[{"title":"孟浩然图 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"却因明主放还山，破帽骑驴骨相寒。\n诗句眼前吟不尽，北风吹雪满长安。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1649,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"孟浩然图 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"蹇驴却指旧山归，可笑先生五字诗。\n仕为不求明主弃，此行安得怨王维。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1650,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"上陶固岭","author":"李俊民","text":"悤悤出郭晓风寒，一片云收爽气山。\n上尽坡陀试回首，人家住在翠微閒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1651,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"野菊","author":"李俊民","text":"风露丛中取次芳，愁边过却几重阳。\n秋光到处多无主，不是闲花不肯香。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1652,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"席次","author":"李俊民","text":"不到西山二十春，风光别后一番新。\n再三点检尊前客，白发相看有几人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1653,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"驴为人盗去 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"磨嫌居士谋生拙，碑恨诗人下道看。\n好在隔花临水处，为谁信辔逐金鞍。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1654,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"驴为人盗去 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"长街愁杀郑昌图，便是徒行鲁大夫。\n纵复东家借还许，不知泥滑敢骑无。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1655,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"渊明归来图","author":"李俊民","text":"一旦仓惶马后牛，衣冠从此折腰羞。\n先生不是归来早，束带人前几督邮。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1656,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"席上戏李巽之","author":"李俊民","text":"薰风原上麦连云，箫鼓家家乐社神。\n半醉尊前喧语笑，老夫愁独泪沾巾。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1657,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和史邦直桥上韵","author":"李俊民","text":"规模杜预见成功，横截长流跨彩虹。\n亭长莫邀来往客，须防中有夺牛公。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1658,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"过龙门","author":"李俊民","text":"流水潺潺漱石根，又还怀古过龙门。\n行人但礼龛中像，谁识当年禹作痕。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1659,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"夜梦月下与数仙子酌酒仍各赋诗","author":"李俊民","text":"天风一埽暮云开，收拾群仙共酒杯。\n但指今宵是新月，不知曾照古人来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1660,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"李俊民","text":"云汉双星聚散频，一年一度事还新。\n民閒送巧浑闲事，不见长生殿里人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1661,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"侄谦甫任长安回 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"归去连昌忆旧游，长安回望使人愁。\n只誇杨氏锦绣谷，曾上李家花萼楼。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1662,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"侄谦甫任长安回 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"枝连叶附本同气，骨亲肉疏今几家。\n但留济叔易一卷，与送蒋兄麻两车。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1663,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"母师圣醉归夜溺伊河抱桥柱而死","author":"李俊民","text":"日日贪杯醉不醒，待将风味学刘伶。\n可怜王子龛前水，夜半寒光落酒星。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1664,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和张文玘 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"景物秋来件件佳，江山都助与诗家。\n我怜五鬼俱难送，先为文穷结柳车。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1665,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和张文玘 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"白发诗人喜诞誇，词源倾倒少陵家。\n问君读后书多少，得满当年惠子车。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1666,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和张文玘 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"书生幢下布衣多，尽是嘲风咏月家。\n若使乌台不弹后，看看欲载十牛车。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1667,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和张文玘 其四","author":"李俊民","text":"数閒茆舍老生涯，篱落相依四五家。\n不见近来门外辙，故人应驾肉轮车。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1668,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂送迎偶得 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"怀抱秋来强自宽，相逢赖有旧青山。\n郊原雨后堪图画，句引诗人兴不闲。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1669,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂送迎偶得 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"出门天地望中宽，马首浓迎著色山。\n诗句满前无可道，恨今不复见闲闲。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1670,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂送迎偶得 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"画手从来说范宽，何如著眼看真山。\n天公不欲山无主，分付筹堂好处闲。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1671,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂送迎偶得 其四","author":"李俊民","text":"诗愁谁道酒能宽，得句多于饭颗山。\n莫使移文诮长往，工夫那取片时闲。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1672,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和平太行路韵 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"六丁驱役鬼神奔，一夜开山掌样平。\n多少往来车马客，尚忧行路涩难行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1673,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和平太行路韵 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"凿开险阻若天成，暂使时閒眼界平。\n却羡长安西去路，青山不管送人行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1674,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和平太行路韵 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"千年古道跨山城，可笑人心自不平。\n容易莫将天险坏，须防闲客此闲行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1675,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和平太行路韵 其四","author":"李俊民","text":"自古太行天下险，纵令禹凿不能平。\n寻常著脚无安处，何况羊肠路上行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1676,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和君瑞月下闻砧","author":"李俊民","text":"夜凉枕上梦频惊，有底秋天不肯明。\n老眼近来闲泪少，那禁月下捣衣声。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1677,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂述怀 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"长恨周人咏黍离，不期亲到闵周时。\n一朝小雅废将尽，何处如今更有诗。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1678,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂述怀 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"白头相见话存亡，可惜漫漫夜转长。\n烦恼尽无安脚处，出门十步九羊肠。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1679,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"访德老 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"夜投破戒远公家，醉墨成章点不加。\n堪笑颍师无手段，听琴人似听琵琶。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1680,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"访德老 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"一朝不饮柰愁何，月下敲门载酒过。\n佳句晓风杨柳岸，醉时吟了醒时哦。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1681,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"老杜醉归图","author":"李俊民","text":"花下骑驴不踏泥，花閒醉后复何之。\n慇勤骥子扶归去，明日重来别有诗。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1682,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"保汉公庙","author":"李俊民","text":"仓惶刘氏未能安，跋扈将军力拔山。\n若使楚人如却子，肯教义士不生还。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1683,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏呈节使王子告","author":"李俊民","text":"唤取佳人舞绣筵，醉中往往爱逃禅。\n我无红袖堪娱夜，翠被薰香独自眠。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1684,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏北台孙讲师仲远","author":"李俊民","text":"何处闲田不可耕，山头烽火水边营。\n道人高卧云千顷，留取南台与鹤鸣。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1685,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"元夜与泰禅洛阳观灯","author":"李俊民","text":"行歌声里落梅风，烁烁华灯万盏红。\n何似吾师方寸地，一轮明月小参中。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1686,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"历阳侯","author":"李俊民","text":"韩生去世冠军废，独望楚强心亦劳。\n谩向鸿门撞玉斗，岂知鹿死在金刀。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1687,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"郦食其","author":"李俊民","text":"多少中原逐鹿人，独凭片舌下齐城。\n淮阴不喜书生事，能免他年猎犬烹。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1688,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"四皓奕棋图","author":"李俊民","text":"坐看咸阳王气收，岂无人杰自安刘。\n都缘鸿鹄心犹在，一局闲棋不到头。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1689,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"魏徵","author":"李俊民","text":"立朝谠议尽良规，谁使君王死后疑。\n一旦銮舆渡辽水，即时扶起墓前碑。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1690,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"王季文南迈怏怏不得意书此以缓之","author":"李俊民","text":"大家都待倚栏干，摘索幽花草棘閒。\n方便春风无不到，忍教雪里一枝寒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1691,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"代别呼延路钤","author":"李俊民","text":"森森戈戟乱如麻，刚把毛锥傍史家。\n弹铗去年门下客，白头今日又天涯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1692,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"梅花堂小酌与河南府马师共","author":"李俊民","text":"往来不绝郑崇门，清浊那分北海尊。\n今夜梅花堂上月，与人作个好黄昏。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1693,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"过济源","author":"李俊民","text":"几年不到竹梅閒，天际归来两鬓斑。\n一片白云风埽尽，双明喜见旧青山。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1694,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"壬寅九日和君玉来韵 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"山城与客醉陶然，日日相陪费万钱。\n马上行人几时去，一杯我欲助离筵。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1695,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"壬寅九日和君玉来韵 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"书生纸里亦枵然，欲去街头恰百钱。\n寄语西风莫相笑，一杯便是菊花筵。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1696,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和段正卿韵 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"悠然相对酒杯闲，忽有新诗落坐閒。\n唤起东篱无限兴，黄花须待与君看。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1697,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和段正卿韵 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"百计寻闲不得闲，功夫那取片时閒。\n谁知九日龙山客，却被秋光冷眼看。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1698,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"秋日有感","author":"李俊民","text":"节气先凋一叶桐，人閒何处不秋风。\n梁园胜事随流水，满目愁云锁故宫。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1699,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"贾佐之以进士充军被挞","author":"李俊民","text":"便从宁越立威名，可信王尼长作兵。\n著甚不谈军旅事，碧油幢下尽书生。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1700,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"孤村","author":"李俊民","text":"舍南舍北地多荒，三两□□□□□。\n□士尽归箕欲手，未应医得眼前疮。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1701,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"解嘲","author":"李俊民","text":"尊前共醉泼醅香，下马谁家白面郎。\n见说千金能买笑，老夫那得一钱囊。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1702,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"王德华默轩","author":"李俊民","text":"春秋岂敢措一字，宾主不须谈两都。\n万事尽皆皮里著，为君终日鼓咙胡。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1703,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"对棋","author":"李俊民","text":"到头不可托安危，那用搜寻局上机。\n纵出吴宫阵图外，阴山未免嫁明妃。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1704,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"送苗世显归上党","author":"李俊民","text":"故人千里寄书来，长恨天涯唤不回。\n行路难行涩如棘，归装莫待北风催。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1705,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"跋鲁直帖","author":"李俊民","text":"鸡毛不择三钱笔，虿尾挥成一幅书。\n莫使观江神会得，因风夺去锦囊虚。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1706,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"许道真醉吟图","author":"李俊民","text":"断蓬踪迹寄天涯，老去情钟恋物华。\n回首锦江春寂寞，一杯愁里赋梨花。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1707,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"探官","author":"李俊民","text":"版图填写百官志，楮券类排千字文。\n堪笑吾儒多伎俩，一时鬻爵僣吾君。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1708,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"跋冯应之许司谏豉羊帖","author":"李俊民","text":"还思写论付官奴，想见临池兴有馀。\n莫把家鸡等闲厌，恐教人笑换羊书。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1709,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"王庭秀悠然轩","author":"李俊民","text":"小轩开后快双明，峭拔南山立翠屏。\n好是晚来新雨过，白云堆里露尖青。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1710,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"同申元帅游司马山","author":"李俊民","text":"千年古庙映崇冈，寂寂空庭草树荒。\n见说旱时求得雨，一池由有老龙藏。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1711,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"留别","author":"李俊民","text":"主人把酒再三留，送客风高势未休。\n更听愁眉歌一曲，尊前肠断小温柔。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1712,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"寒食戏书","author":"李俊民","text":"蓦见花閒弄药回，同心髻绾绿云堆。\n多情更有墙东月，送得秋千影过来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1713,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏杨成之","author":"李俊民","text":"客路风霜颇倦游，出门又是一番愁。\n行人立马无情甚，扶上征鞍不自由。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1714,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"李晋王坟","author":"李俊民","text":"雄名凛凛振沙陀，为国功深柰老何。\n多少三垂冈上恨，伶人都进百年歌。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1715,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"游沁园","author":"李俊民","text":"多少庭台堕劫灰，胜游踪迹几残碑。\n风流人物今谁在，水绿山青似旧时。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1716,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"申元帅四隐图 其一 严子陵","author":"李俊民","text":"羊裘隐迹唤难回，曾犯当年帝座来。\n京洛江湖各天性，钓鱼台不羡云台。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1717,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"申元帅四隐图 其二 陶渊明","author":"李俊民","text":"迎门儿女笑牵衣，回首人閒万事非。\n自是田园有真乐，督邮那解遣君归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1718,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"申元帅四隐图 其三 孟浩然","author":"李俊民","text":"平生只有在山缘，北阙归来也自贤。\n破帽蹇驴风雪里，新诗句句总堪传。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1719,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"申元帅四隐图 其四 李太白","author":"李俊民","text":"谪在人閒凡几年，诗中豪杰酒中仙。\n不因采石江头月，那得骑鲸去上天。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1720,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"大颠图 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"星斗文章世所传，狂澜回在禹功前。\n先生不踏潮阳路，震旦花开几大颠。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1721,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"大颠图 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"一夕投荒万里行，增光日月更谁能。\n相逢尽说空门话，多少人閒有发僧。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1722,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"三害图 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"慷慨平西气不衰，勇于三害欲除时。\n流芳已入忠臣传，何处人閒更有诗。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1723,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}}]